usage: unitron [-h] {asm,mac,preprocess,dis,roundtrip,bin2db,text,gfx,z80,play,lsp} ...

NGPC (TLCS-900/H) toolchain

positional arguments:
  {asm,mac,preprocess,dis,roundtrip,bin2db,text,gfx,z80,play,lsp}
    asm                 assemble (and link) asm900 sources into a raw image
    mac (preprocess)    run the macro preprocessor only
    dis                 disassemble: a listing, or (-o DIR) rebuildable asm900 source
    roundtrip           dis -> asm a ROM and compare the bytes
    bin2db              binary file -> labeled asm900 db lines
    text                text file + character map -> asm900 db lines
    gfx                 2bpp tiles <-> indexed PNG (plain sheet or map layout); PNG palette -> words
    z80                 the Z80 sound CPU: dis, asm, roundtrip (docs/z80.md)
    play                play a ROM headlessly to map it: states, inputs, screenshots (docs/play.md)
    lsp                 language server for editors (docs/editor.md)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
